From 51d47240c30a6ad32c6ec66e85a38a1c13ff1113 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:49:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] API 44: entities.damage-entities-in-box, part 1 (damage and
 fire; for Mekanism's lasers)

The living mobs whose feet are in the box take the amount as generic damage and burn for as many ticks unless they don't burn; the call returns each mob hit with its damage, counted at the call; the blows land after it. Players, mod entities, shields and immunity come in part 2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
